error[keywords]: `Object` is a keyword and may not be used as an identifier
   ┌ test.idl:2:8
   │
 2 │ native Object;              // 'Object' is a keyword
   ·        ^^^^^^ this is an IDL keyword
 3 │ native ValueBase;           // 'ValueBase' is a keyword
   └──
 help: the keyword can be escaped by changing to `_Object`
 note: keywords are matched case-insensitively against identifiers

